part igt_2
  tally 1
  law
  note "IGT-2 · When the tax arises, and the base: for a gift, the contract's day, or without one the day it is performed (.1); the base is the market value that day less debts taken over; fund units at the price of the last valuation day on or before it (.2); rounded to whole dukats (.3, GEN-5 .1)."

source igt_2 "Inheritance and Gift Tax Act, IGT-2 When the tax arises, and the base (tmp/cases/law/acts.md)"

version igt2_v1
  cite igt_2
  governs 2018-01-01..
  known 2017-09-01
  note "IGT-2 v1, in force 2018-01-01 until replaced, published 2017-09-01; governs acquisitions from 2018-01-01."
